  "measurementBasis": "CMC original jewel-case inspection dimensions and standard-tray drawings; NTSC-U/C specimen photographs. The envelope uses midpoint values from CMC assembly inspection ranges, not proof of the original Sony supplier. Fine molded features, booklet leaves and paper-fit dimensions are approximate. Clear plastic rendering depends on the importing engine.",
  "changes": [
    "A standard-compatible 142.35 \u00d7 124.75 \u00d7 10.4 mm envelope with a separate front-lid pivot.",
    "Clear molded lid and removable tray with a central retaining hub and approximate rib, clip and hinge detail.",
    "Independent front booklet, booklet reverse, rear wrap and inner wrap artwork targets; spine folds share the tray-card UV field.",
    "The Open clip rotates the lid to 110 degrees. The standalone CD remains a separate media asset.",
    "Added self-contained editable source, a named Open clip, reviewed previews and exact-input validation reports."
  ],
